WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.783
(lively music)

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.490
- [Narrator] In the town of
Grindelwald in Switzerland,

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.340
people like sledding and
heading to the ski slopes.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:31.990
After all, they are at the
foot of the Eiger Mountain,

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.863
part of the stunning Swiss Alps.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.220
But if you look close enough,
you'll see something else,

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.683
something different
coming down the slopes.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.217
It's the Velogemel.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.950
- [Narrator] This odd bike quickly became

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:07.400
part of the town's identity.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.010
And over 100 years later,

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.693
it is still used for
leisure sledding and racing.

00:01:23.719 --> 00:01:26.610
- [Narrator] Grindelwald is
the birthplace of Velogemels.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:30.050
And to day this day, they're
only manufactured in one place,

00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:31.510
which means if you're riding one,

00:01:31.510 --> 00:01:33.330
it came from this workshop,

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.960
where despite the addition
of modern machinery,

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.513
the principals of its
construction remain the same.

00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:05.833
(elegant music)

